From: Suruchi Agarwal <quic_suruchia@quicinc.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:11:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: ppe: register EDMA netdevice ports

Provide the final netdevice operations, phylink attachment and port registration, including DT labels. Keep controller allocation separate from port lifetime.

Split from:
  0332-net-ethernet-qualcomm-Add-netdevice-support-for-QCOM.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: Add netdevice support for QCOM  IPQ9574 chipset.
  0333-net-ethernet-qualcomm-Add-Rx-Ethernet-DMA-support.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: Add Rx Ethernet DMA support
  0334-net-ethernet-qualcomm-Add-Tx-Ethernet-DMA-support.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: Add Tx Ethernet DMA support
  0336-net-ethernet-qualcomm-add-EDMA-ethtool-with-safe-strings.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: add EDMA ethtool support with  initialized strings
  0342-net-qualcomm-Update-IPQ9574-PPE-driver.patch - net: qualcomm: Update IPQ9574 PPE driver

Merged from:
  0332-net-ethernet-qualcomm-Add-netdevice-support-for-QCOM.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: Add netdevice support for QCOM  IPQ9574 chipset.
  0333-net-ethernet-qualcomm-Add-Rx-Ethernet-DMA-support.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: Add Rx Ethernet DMA support
  0334-net-ethernet-qualcomm-Add-Tx-Ethernet-DMA-support.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: Add Tx Ethernet DMA support
  0336-net-ethernet-qualcomm-add-EDMA-ethtool-with-safe-strings.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: add EDMA ethtool support with  initialized strings
  0339-net-ethernet-qualcomm-Add-support-for-label-property.patch - net: ethernet: qualcomm: Add support for label property for  EDMA port
  0342-net-qualcomm-Update-IPQ9574-PPE-driver.patch - net: qualcomm: Update IPQ9574 PPE driver

